      "heading": null,
      "bodyHtml": "<p class=\"font_8 wixui-rich-text__text\"><span class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">This innovative solution provides customers with a hassle-free way to register their tracking devices. Whether you are a new or existing customer, you can sign up and register your device at any time by simply entering the IMEI number. As soon as your device is “Connected”, you will have access to our comprehensive fleet management system.</span></p><p class=\"font_8 wixui-rich-text__text\"><strong><span class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">Advantages of Klik and Connect:</span></strong></p><p class=\"font_8 wixui-rich-text__text\"><span class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">Quick and easy registration:</span></p><p class=\"font_8 wixui-rich-text__text\"><span class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">Save time and hassle with our automated registration process.</span></p><p class=\"font_8 wixui-rich-text__text\"><strong><span class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">Available anytime:</span></strong></p><p class=\"font_8 wixui-rich-text__text\"><span class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">Register your devices at your convenience, day or night.</span></p><p class=\"font_8 wixui-rich-text__text\"><strong><span class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">Instant access to fleet management:</span></strong></p><p class=\"font_8 wixui-rich-text__text\"><span class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">Get full control of your fleet as soon as your device is connected.</span></p><p class=\"font_8 wixui-rich-text__text\"><strong><span class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">Ideal for both new and existing customers:</span></strong></p><p class=\"font_8 wixui-rich-text__text\"><span class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">Whether you’re just starting out or an existing customer, Klik and Connect is the easiest way to register your devices. Experience the hassle-free way of registering your tracking devices with Klik and Connect. Get started today!</span></p>",
      "bodyText": "This innovative solution provides customers with a hassle-free way to register their tracking devices. Whether you are a new or existing customer, you can sign up and register your device at any time by simply entering the IMEI number. As soon as your device is “Connected”, you will have access to our comprehensive fleet management system.Advantages of Klik and Connect:Quick and easy registration:Save time and hassle with our automated registration process.Available anytime:Register your devices at your convenience, day or night.Instant access to fleet management:Get full control of your fleet as soon as your device is connected.Ideal for both new and existing customers:Whether you’re just starting out or an existing customer, Klik and Connect is the easiest way to register your devices. Experience the hassle-free way of registering your tracking devices with Klik and Connect. Get started today!",
